This repository does NOT bundle its external CPU core. The Bremen riscv-vp core
(MIT) is fetched separately into third_party/ (gitignored) by
tools/third_party/setup_third_party.sh. See THIRD_PARTY.md.

An internal binary build of this product can include a private SystemC
implementation based on the SAURIA accelerator architecture from Barcelona
Supercomputing Center. The public source tree does not include that model.
The upstream SAURIA design is Copyright 2022 Jordi Fornt Mas and is available
under Apache-2.0 WITH SHL-2.1. See licenses/SAURIA.SHL-2.1 and
licenses/SAURIA.PROVENANCE.md.

